{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/03606607866480533ce3d13eb64f1323.poster.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/03606607866480533ce3d13eb64f1323.webm?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Amberial Dreams is an evolving 2D physics-based precision platformer. Control a sphere and its speed through an enchanting universe filled with wonders and wicked levels. <br><br>5th game in the series of famous flash games, Amberial Dreams scales everything up whilst keeping true to its success formula, loved by more than 2 million players! Bringing a new engine, an exhaustive level editor and a narrative campaign full of colourful characters, Amberial Dreams is ready for you to enjoy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/58fd5a2caca9c9143adf55b86c0949cd.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/1d9104f030c463d8d87bfafcb71f751b.poster.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/1d9104f030c463d8d87bfafcb71f751b.webm?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/1d9104f030c463d8d87bfafcb71f751b.mp4?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rolling left and right, will you be able to tackle the challenge? <br>Use the different surfaces to control your momentum, play in null gravity and interact with the many different pieces to finish more than 50 handcrafted levels. New levels and mechanics will also be added throughout Early Access!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/12f8d49addc4c3d6362d44844ad2849d.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/f9e38622039ef4d01ed90ddd9a9c37c7.poster.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/f9e38622039ef4d01ed90ddd9a9c37c7.webm?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/f9e38622039ef4d01ed90ddd9a9c37c7.mp4?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Amberial Dreams offers a unique difficulty with wicked levels. Test your skill against pixel perfect levels filled with devilish traps. Only players having mastered the game can hope to finish them. Not to mention finishing the levels while recovering all the collectible moons. We tried... and we could not beat them all. Can you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/423d093db71307b2bd2c1636352b5e2e.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/2a5459f27f8e23273a4bd934f3599238.poster.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/2a5459f27f8e23273a4bd934f3599238.webm?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/2a5459f27f8e23273a4bd934f3599238.mp4?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Follow the story of Amber as she wakes up from her long slumber, alone, to find her former idyllic world transformed to the core. Incarnate her avatar and explore 4 different biomes, each with their own gameplay twists and narrative. Change the world as you progress and uncover hidden secrets. Where are your missing sisters and why did everything change so drastically?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/fa12264e758878a9b95886a28fd20e7b.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/8a2e530dcb7d2618bb6730f6aa54ae6d.poster.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/8a2e530dcb7d2618bb6730f6aa54ae6d.webm?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/8a2e530dcb7d2618bb6730f6aa54ae6d.mp4?t=1738313735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We give the players the same tools we used to develop the game.  We wanted to offer you the best experience with the ability to customize every level you have beaten in the campaign or to create your own with dozens of unique pieces. Carefully place portals, deadly moving spikes, gravity rays and so much more to craft your own playfield. You will never run out of possibilities with the addition of new elements throughout Early Access. <br><br>Once you are happy with your levels, share them with the world and explore theirs! Thanks to a powerful tagging and research tool, find the levels that you want to play or give the featured ones a try! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/4f8a3d5bf0df3e7b374d2a4b3993443f.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917140/extras/532a9907176ae907a87f966923656d05.avif?t=1738313735\" width=616 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Join our official Discord server!</strong>\u202fThe community is an essential part of our game, and we want to build it with you!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b1263b01310e5dc29876e960ba2917b26d38a7b1.jpg","localized_name":"With a promising start...","name":"With a promising start...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917140/b1263b01310e5dc29876e960ba2917b26d38a7b1.jpg"},{"icon":"15719edc36158faddd787d226d56476aaf3db713.jpg","localized_name":"... and dreams of creation...","name":"... and dreams of creation...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917140/15719edc36158faddd787d226d56476aaf3db713.jpg"},{"icon":"2a3c7e41061c1a6efc61b39487f5f397f0832a5c.jpg","localized_name":"... in a burst of light...","name":"... in a burst of light...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917140/2a3c7e41061c1a6efc61b39487f5f397f0832a5c.jpg"},{"icon":"7e6fc0b61ed818ac8f87ab81bbe8f7e292fd8694.jpg","localized_name":"... her wings materialized...","name":"... her wings materialized...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917140/7e6fc0b61ed818ac8f87ab81bbe8f7e292fd8694.jpg"},{"icon":"c153136363c35dabd12d8472915d65aaf64164fd.jpg","localized_name":"... and she fell through the night.","name":"... and she fell through the night.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps